{"seq":1,"slug":"motor-transformer-maintenance","title":"电机与变压器维护","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/equipment-maintenance/motor-transformer-maintenance","wordCount":1659,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"电机与变压器维护\">电机与变压器维护</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>三相异步电动机是工厂中数量最多的动力设备——从车间风机、水泵到机床主轴、传送带驱动，几乎无处不在。据统计，工业用电中约 70% 由电动机消耗。电机一旦发生故障，将直接导致生产中断。掌握电机结构原理、故障诊断方法和日常保养技能，是机电维修工最基本的岗位能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三相异步电动机结构与原理\">三相异步电动机结构与原理</h3><p>三相异步电动机由定子和转子两大部分组成：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部件</th>\n<th>组成</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定子铁芯</td>\n<td>硅钢片叠压</td>\n<td>导磁（减少涡流损耗）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定子绕组</td>\n<td>三相对称绕组</td>\n<td>通电产生旋转磁场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转子铁芯</td>\n<td>硅钢片叠压</td>\n<td>导磁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转子绕组</td>\n<td>鼠笼式铝条/铜条</td>\n<td>感应产生电流和转矩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机座</td>\n<td>铸铁/铸铝</td>\n<td>支撑固定、散热</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端盖+轴承</td>\n<td>前后端盖、滚动轴承</td>\n<td>支撑转子旋转</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工作原理：定子三相绕组通入三相交流电 → 产生旋转磁场（转速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi>f</mi></mrow><mi>p</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_1 = \\frac{60f}{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4133em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 为频率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 为极对数）→ 转子导体切割磁力线 → 感应出电流 → 载流导体在磁场中受力 → 转子旋转。</p>\n<p>转子转速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 略低于旋转磁场转速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（否则无相对运动就无感应电流），这就是&quot;异步&quot;的含义。转差率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = \\frac{n_1 - n}{n_1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>额定工况下转差率通常为 2%-6%。例如 4 极电机（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>），电源频率 50Hz：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1500</mn><mtext>r/min</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_1 = \\frac{60 \\times 50}{2} = 1500\\text{r/min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">r/min</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实际转速约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1450</mn><mtext>r/min</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 1450\\text{r/min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1450</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">r/min</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"电机常见故障诊断\">电机常见故障诊断</h3><p><strong>过热故障</strong>——电机温升超过允许值（B 级绝缘允许温升 80K）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>过热原因</th>\n<th>判断依据</th>\n<th>处理措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过载运行</td>\n<td>电流超过铭牌额定值</td>\n<td>减轻负荷或更换大功率电机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电压不平衡</td>\n<td>三相电流差异 &gt;10%</td>\n<td>检查供电线路和接线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通风散热不良</td>\n<td>风叶损坏/散热片堵塞</td>\n<td>清理或更换风叶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺相运行</td>\n<td>两相电流异常增大</td>\n<td>检查熔断器和接线端子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轴承磨损</td>\n<td>运行时有异响</td>\n<td>更换轴承</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>振动故障</strong>——超标振动（一般要求 ≤ 4.5mm/s）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>转子动平衡不良：重新做动平衡</li>\n<li>联轴器不对中：用百分表重新对中</li>\n<li>地脚螺栓松动：紧固螺栓</li>\n<li>轴承间隙过大：更换轴承</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>异响故障</strong>判断口诀：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>&quot;嗡嗡&quot;声——电磁问题（缺相、绕组短路）</li>\n<li>&quot;咔咔&quot;声——机械碰擦（定转子相擦）</li>\n<li>&quot;嘶嘶&quot;声——轴承缺油或损坏</li>\n</ul>\n<p>诊断方法：<strong>断电法</strong>——合闸瞬间如果异响立即消失，为电磁原因；如果惯性旋转中仍有异响，为机械原因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"变频器基本操作\">变频器基本操作</h3><p>变频器通过改变电源频率来调节电机转速，实现软启动、调速和节能运行。</p>\n<p>变频器调速原理：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi>f</mi></mrow><mi>p</mi></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi>f</mi></mrow><mi>p</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = \\frac{60f}{p}(1-s) \\approx \\frac{60f}{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>改变频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 即可改变转速。V/f 控制模式下保持电压与频率的比值恒定，确保电机磁通不变、转矩稳定。</p>\n<p>基本参数设置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>典型设置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>额定功率</td>\n<td>匹配电机</td>\n<td>与电机铭牌一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>额定频率</td>\n<td>基频</td>\n<td>50Hz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最高频率</td>\n<td>最高转速</td>\n<td>50Hz 或 60Hz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加速时间</td>\n<td>启动过程</td>\n<td>5-15s（视负载而定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减速时间</td>\n<td>停车过程</td>\n<td>5-15s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行模式</td>\n<td>控制方式</td>\n<td>面板/端子/通信</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>变频器常见报警及处理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>OC（过电流）</strong>：检查电机是否堵转、负载是否过重</li>\n<li><strong>OV（过电压）</strong>：减速时间设长或加装制动电阻</li>\n<li><strong>OH（过热）</strong>：检查环境温度和散热风扇</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"电机保养规程\">电机保养规程</h3><p>日常保养等级制度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>保养级别</th>\n<th>周期</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日常点检</td>\n<td>每班</td>\n<td>听声音、摸温度、看电流、查接地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一级保养</td>\n<td>每月</td>\n<td>清扫外壳灰尘、检查接线端子、测绝缘电阻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二级保养</td>\n<td>每半年</td>\n<td>更换润滑脂、检测轴承间隙、检查风叶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大修</td>\n<td>2-3年</td>\n<td>拆检绕组绝缘、更换轴承、重新浸漆</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>绝缘电阻测量：使用 500V 兆欧表（摇表），测量绕组对地绝缘电阻。合格标准：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>绝缘</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mtext>MΩ</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{绝缘} \\geq 0.5\\text{MΩ}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">绝缘</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MΩ</span></span></span></span></span></span>（在潮湿环境下）。测量前必须确认电机完全断电并放电。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026 年电机与驱动技术向高效化和智能化发展。IE5 超高效电机和永磁同步电机（PMSM）在新项目中占比持续提升，相比传统 IE2 电机可节能 20-30%。智能电机集成温度、振动和电流传感器，通过物联网实时上报健康状态，支持预测性维护——在轴承实际损坏前 2-4 周发出预警。直驱电机（取消减速箱）在机床和机器人领域加速应用，减少了传动链故障点。此外，碳化硅（SiC）功率器件在变频器中的应用使开关频率提高、谐波减少、电机运行更安静。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>一台 4 极三相异步电动机铭牌标注：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>7.5</mn><mtext>kW</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_N = 7.5\\text{kW}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kW</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1460</mn><mtext>r/min</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_N = 1460\\text{r/min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1460</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">r/min</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>380</mn><mtext>V</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_N = 380\\text{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">380</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15.2</mn><mtext>A</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_N = 15.2\\text{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15.2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">A</span></span></span></span></span></span>。计算其额定转差率、同步转速和效率（假设功率因数为 0.86）。</li>\n<li>某电机运行中温度逐渐升高，用钳形电流表测得三相电流分别为 14A、15A、6A。判断故障类型并说明排查步骤。</li>\n<li>变频器控制的传送带电机需要在 8 秒内从 0 加速到 1200r/min。如果电机为 4 极，计算变频器的目标频率和加速时间参数应如何设置。</li>\n<li>编写一份电机月度保养记录表模板，包含检查项目、标准值、实测值和判定结果列。</li>\n<li>实训操作：拆装一台 1.1kW 三相异步电动机，测量绕组直流电阻（三相平衡度）和对地绝缘电阻，记录数据并判定是否合格。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>电机与变压器维护是机电维修工的看家本领。深入理解三相异步电动机的结构与工作原理，才能做到&quot;知其然更知其所以然&quot;地诊断故障；掌握过热、振动、异响三大类故障的判断方法和处理措施，是快速恢复生产的关键；变频器操作技能适应了现代工厂节能调速的普遍需求；规范化的保养制度则将故障消灭在萌芽状态。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"电机与变压器维护","id":"电机与变压器维护"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"三相异步电动机结构与原理","id":"三相异步电动机结构与原理"},{"level":3,"text":"电机常见故障诊断","id":"电机常见故障诊断"},{"level":3,"text":"变频器基本操作","id":"变频器基本操作"},{"level":3,"text":"电机保养规程","id":"电机保养规程"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自动化生产线","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/plc-automation/automated-production-lines"},"next":{"title":"机床故障诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/equipment-maintenance/machine-tool-diagnosis"}}